WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.156 --> 00:00:40.121
Jane and Pip are at Gran's gate.

2
00:00:40.122 --> 00:00:44.741
"Have fun with Gran!" Mom says.

3
00:00:44.742 --> 00:00:48.196
Mom and Dad drive off.

4
00:00:48.197 --> 00:00:51.287
Gran and the kids wave.

5
00:00:51.288 --> 00:01:00.803
Then they go inside.

6
00:01:00.804 --> 00:01:07.676
"What can we do?" Jane asks.

7
00:01:07.677 --> 00:01:16.599
Gran gets an old box.

8
00:01:16.600 --> 00:01:19.064
"You can play Sweet Land.

9
00:01:19.065 --> 00:01:21.956
It's a fun game."

10
00:01:21.957 --> 00:01:33.426
Pip smiles. "A candy game!"

11
00:01:33.427 --> 00:01:38.880
Gran goes to make lunch.

12
00:01:38.881 --> 00:01:42.721
"Set up the game," Jane says.

13
00:01:42.722 --> 00:01:49.346
"Don't tell me what to do," Pip says.

14
00:01:49.347 --> 00:01:56.880
Pip takes out a map.

15
00:01:56.881 --> 00:02:01.810
"I want the red dot," Jane says.

16
00:02:01.811 --> 00:02:06.242
But Pip grabs it fast.

17
00:02:06.243 --> 00:02:10.471
Jane is mad. "That's not nice!"

18
00:02:10.472 --> 00:02:13.986
Pip puts the red dot on a tile.

19
00:02:13.987 --> 00:02:17.171
Jane gets a white dot.

20
00:02:17.172 --> 00:02:19.889
Then she picks up the dice.

21
00:02:19.890 --> 00:02:22.791
"I will go," Jane says.

22
00:02:22.792 --> 00:02:26.378
But Pip grabs the dice.

23
00:02:26.379 --> 00:02:30.021
"I got a six!" he says.

24
00:02:30.022 --> 00:02:33.018
"Stop that!" Jane says.

25
00:02:33.019 --> 00:02:41.194
Pip slides his dot and grins.

26
00:02:41.195 --> 00:02:47.990
Jane's face goes red. "You went ten tiles!

27
00:02:47.991 --> 00:02:50.930
You can't do that!"

